# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Files in this list are NOT uploaded to Cloudflare on `wrangler deploy`.
# Syntax follows .gitignore.  Only index.html and the assets it
# actually references should ship to the edge.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Internal design system & docs (dev only) ---
aurio-components.html
aurio-tokens.css
design-system.md
tokens.json
CLAUDE.md
README.md
*.md

# --- Redundant PNG sources (WebP equivalents are what index.html references) ---
bg-listen.png
bg-remote.png
# 产品图带盒子.png is the 4.4 MB master for the setup screen; the app ships the
# optimized case-hero.jpg instead, so keep the heavy source out of the deploy.
产品图带盒子.png
# NOTE: 产品图.png IS referenced by index.html (splash + pairing screen),
# so it is intentionally NOT excluded here — it must ship.

# --- Unused SVG sources (icons are inlined into index.html) ---
嘈杂.svg
对话.svg
通用.svg
亲友代调icon.svg

# --- Deploy-time config (not served as static asset) ---
wrangler.toml
wrangler.jsonc
wrangler.json
.assetsignore

# --- System / tooling / build cache ---
.DS_Store
.wrangler/
.git/
node_modules/
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
*.log
